====================================================================================================
STEP 4 -- CAN THE ARM'S SIGNATURE BE REPRODUCED BY HAND, from the control?
====================================================================================================
  H1-H4 say the penalty sees amplitude and not arrangement, B-1 the reverse. The move that
  improves the penalty while worsening B-1 is therefore AMPLIFY (free for B-1, good for
  the penalty) plus SMOOTH (bad for both, but amplification more than pays for it).
  ⛔ Neither alone will do it: scaling leaves B-1 EXACT, and smoothing alone makes the
  penalty WORSE. If no (scale, smooth) cell lands near the arm, this mechanism is refuted.

